# Template for local API keys — copy this file to .env.local and fill in your
# own keys. .env.local is gitignored so real keys never reach the repository.
#
# Both variables below are bundled into the client-side JS at build time
# (that's what the VITE_ prefix means to Vite) — neither is a true secret.
# See README.md "API keys & security" for details.
#
# MapTiler (map + geocoding): https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
#   Make sure the key's allowed-origins list includes localhost AND the
#   production domain, otherwise the API answers 403 "Key usage restricted".
#   This restriction is what makes it reasonably safe to ship in the browser.
# Pexels (location photos, optional): https://www.pexels.com/api/
#   Pexels keys cannot be origin-restricted, so this key is fully exposed
#   once built. Leave empty to fall back to the gradient/emoji visuals.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=
VITE_PEXELS_KEY=
